<title>SPAIN: Telefonica won't confirm or deny TISA buy.</title>
<headline>Telefonica won't confirm or deny TISA buy.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish telephone operator Telefonica said it would neither confirm nor deny press reports that it would buy the government's 23.78 percent stake in its international unit Telefonica Internacional (TISA).</p>
<p>&quot;I can't confirm or deny the article,&quot; a spokesman for Telefonica said. &quot;From Telefonica no-one has said this is the case and this idea hasn't been taken any further.&quot;</p>
<p>Telefonica already owns the rest of TISA, whose principal business areas are in Argentina, Peru, Chile, Colombia, Venezuela and Puerto Rico.</p>
<p>--Madrid newsroom +34 1 585 2160</p>
</text>
